# Where PDF2EPUB, the conversion engine, comes from (no quotes; ~ isn't expanded):
#   a folder: installed editable, so changes there show up at once
#     PDF2EPUB_SOURCE=/home/you/Projects/PDF2EPUB
#   anything pip installs, such as a release tag
PDF2EPUB_SOURCE=git+https://github.com/andriaberi/PDF2EPUB.git@v1.1.0
